senses
  entry
    definition "notify of danger, potential harm, or risk"
    examples ("The director warned him that he might be fired" "The doctor warned me about the dangers of smoking")
    id oewn-00871877-v
    partOfSpeech v
  entry
    definition "advise or counsel in terms of someone's behavior"
    examples ("I warned him not to go too far" "I warn you against false assumptions" "She warned him to be quiet")
    id oewn-00872241-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (discourage admonish monish)
  entry
    definition "ask to go away"
    examples ("The old man warned the children off his property")
    id oewn-00834732-v
    partOfSpeech v
  entry
    definition "notify, usually in advance"
    examples ("I warned you that I would ask some difficult questions")
    id oewn-00834568-v
    partOfSpeech v
